                new("In the last paragraph, what does \"revolution\" mean?", ["A wheel turning once", "A bicycle race", "A big change in the way people live", "A kind of road"], 2, "The text has shown how bicycles changed work, travel and freedom, so \"revolution\" means a big change."),
